          "gu_accumulating_ash_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After a Xuan Yuan Divine Pheasant kills the crocodile king, the two find a red glass fragment, the remains of flame stomach Gu. The king had activated it for defense, and the pheasant’s force destroyed the Gu.",
